 Basic request (auto-creates conversation):
  curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/rephrase/stream \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -d '{
      "model": "qwen3:4b",
      "prompt": "Rephrase this text"
    }'

  curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/rephrase/stream \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -d '{
      "model": "qwen3:4b",
      "prompt": "Follow-up question",
      "conversation_id": "uuid-from-first-request"
    }'

  Disable history for specific request:
  curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/rephrase/stream \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -d '{
      "model": "qwen3:4b",
      "prompt": "Don't save this",
      "save_history": false
    }'
